          "text": "The vault script admits only the owner path until claimHeight, so the base ratio must cover the whole term's drawdown. P(bad debt) at the shipped ratios: A 0.00436134, B 0.0505545, C 0.477739 (tolerances 0.50%, 1.00%, 2.00%); the lowest reachable within the registry bounds: A 0.30%, B 5.06%, C 47.77%.",
